WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
A boy at a blacksmith's forge.

2
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.290
Sparks fly.

3
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.450
Years later, a gentleman in a fine coat
greets an old friend in his stiff Sunday

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.130
best, and wishes he would go.

5
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:17.080
It began at a grand house, when he
stopped "to look at my coarse hands and my

6
00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.780
common boots."

7
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.920
A hero ashamed of the people who love him.

8
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.880
Should we still like him?

9
00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.420
In this mission, you'll
hear two Pips in one voice:

10
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.130
the boy who acts, and the
older man telling the story.

11
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.940
You'll find where his shame
begins, at Satis House.

12
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:38.040
And you'll follow him into
the novel's third stage,

13
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.540
and ask whether he changes at all.

14
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:44.210
Your mission: decide whether
we should still like Pip.
